WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.600
A meal plan in Notes lists three dinners and four pantry staples.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.400
Press Option–Shift–Space and ask for this week’s Trader Joe’s list.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Beside adds quantities for the ingredients to buy.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.600
Choose Copy on the seven-item list.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.917
Paste the list into the Trader Joe’s note with Command–V.
